 design and to compute standard errors and 95% confidence intervals for the estimates.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Two-tailed t tests were used to establish significant differences.\"}, {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"Not calculated because fewer than 35 girls reported being current cigarette smokers.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}